# Migrations

Add owned SQL migrations for `__name__` here. From the workspace root:

```sh
DATABASE_APP=__name__ bun run migration:create __name__-baseline
```

Keep the `-- Up Migration` and `-- Down Migration` sections. Migrations run with
the database owner (`__PREFIX___DB_MIGRATION_USERNAME`) and grant the restricted
`__role__` role exactly what the running application needs. Optional ordered
seeds belong in `../seeds/*.sql`. No tables, SQL behavior or seeds are generated.
